 that breach the interior.<br>Setting up your defenses correctly greatly increases your chances of surviving the night.</strong><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659810/extras/1403e4dacb3388537a5bf1ac5b98bab7.poster.avif?t=1747667255\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659810/extras/1403e4dacb3388537a5bf1ac5b98bab7.webm?t=1747667255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659810/extras/1403e4dacb3388537a5bf1ac5b98bab7.mp4?t=1747667255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Blood Moon!</strong></h2><strong>When the Blood Moon rises, the hunger within the zombies becomes unstoppable.<br>They see nothing. They hear nothing.<br>They want only one thing: flesh.<br>Doors, traps, defenses... none of it matters anymore.<br>Tonight, an army of the truly ravenous dead will be at your doorstep.</strong><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659810/extras/0c74c5d4aaa22bcfe89257ce7daa990a.poster.avif?t=1747667255\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659810/extras/0c74c5d4aaa22bcfe89257ce7daa990a.webm?t=1747667255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659810/extras/0c74c5d4aaa22bcfe89257ce7daa990a.mp4?t=1747667255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p>",
